value.DDA_DEBUG.7=Profile: No Voxel Writes
option.DDA_DEBUG.comment=Magenta: uncaptured or air; red: opaque; yellow: emitter; green: pass-through; blue: outside volume. Direct Light Only excludes vanilla, sun, and ambient from terrain shading. Profile modes intentionally disable successive stages; they are not normal visual settings.
screen.DDA_FOG_CONFIG=Light Contribution to Volumetric Fog
option.DDA_FOG=Light Contribution to Volumetric Fog
option.DDA_FOG_STRENGTH=Light Fog Strength
option.DDA_FOG.comment=Traces the same direct hard-shadow lighting as surfaces. Experimental; expensive.

option.DDA_CAPTURE_ALL=Full Shadow-Pass Capture

option.DDA_GROUP_LIGHTS=Clustered Area Lights
option.DDA_GROUP_LIGHTS.comment=Approximate dense homogeneous rectangular emitter patches with weighted representative rays. Off retains individual block lighting.
option.DDA_GROUP_DISTANCE=Minimum Cluster Distance
option.DDA_GROUP_DISTANCE.comment=Lower values group nearby emitters more aggressively. Higher values preserve more individual lighting.

option.DDA_DEFERRED=Direct Lighting Pipeline
value.DDA_DEFERRED.0=Forward (reference)
value.DDA_DEFERRED.1=Deferred Full Resolution
value.DDA_DEFERRED.2=Deferred Adaptive (2x2)
option.DDA_DEFERRED.comment=Full resolution preserves per-pixel rays. Adaptive modes reconstruct direct lighting only on compatible receiver planes; thin shadows may be approximated.

option.DDA_TRACE_VOLUME=DDA Traced Volume
option.DDA_TRACE_VOLUME.comment=Percentage of the full voxel volume used for accurate DDA receiver lighting. Outer region uses LPV diffusion, with an eight-block transition. 100% disables the hybrid LPV.
value.DDA_TRACE_VOLUME.10=10%
value.DDA_TRACE_VOLUME.25=25%
value.DDA_TRACE_VOLUME.50=50%
value.DDA_TRACE_VOLUME.75=75%
value.DDA_TRACE_VOLUME.100=100% (DDA Only)
option.DDA_LPV_BRIGHTNESS=Outer LPV Brightness

option.DDA_LPV_STRIDE=Outer LPV Cell Size
value.DDA_LPV_STRIDE.1=1 Block (Full)
value.DDA_LPV_STRIDE.2=2 Blocks (Fast)
option.DDA_LPV_STRIDE.comment=2-block diffusion uses one eighth as many LPV cells while retaining the full world-space lighting volume. Distant shadow detail and brightness can differ.

profile.DDA_FAST=DDA Fast (Regional, Adaptive)
profile.DDA_FAST.comment=Regional emitter selection, adaptive 4x4 lighting, four area samples and guarded capture. May approximate lights and show sample banding.

option.DDA_REGIONAL_LIGHTS=Light Selection
value.DDA_REGIONAL_LIGHTS.0=Per-Pixel (Quality)
value.DDA_REGIONAL_LIGHTS.1=Regional (Fast)
option.DDA_REGIONAL_LIGHTS.comment=Fast: all lights in regions with up to eight candidates, otherwise four weighted representatives per world-aligned 4-block region. Exact ray visibility but approximate light selection. Quality: existing ray budget and optional emitter clustering.
option.DDA_GLASS_STRENGTH=Stained Glass Tint Strength
option.DDA_GLASS_STRENGTH.comment=Filters the source color. Higher settings give more saturated tint and stronger absorption.
profile.DDA_QUALITY=DDA Quality (16 Rays, Deferred)
profile.DDA_QUALITY.comment=Exact emitter selection, full-resolution deferred lighting, sixteen area samples and full capture. Very expensive.

option.DDA_CACHE_INTERVAL=Light Search Interval
option.DDA_CACHE_INTERVAL.comment=Regional cache: Near Every Frame + Outer 1/8 updates the central column and one of eight outer columns each frame. Other modes refresh uniformly. Outer new lights may take up to seven additional frames to appear. Blockers update every frame. Quality mode always searches every frame.
value.DDA_CACHE_INTERVAL.1=Every Frame
value.DDA_CACHE_INTERVAL.2=Every 2 Frames
value.DDA_CACHE_INTERVAL.4=Every 4 Frames
value.DDA_CACHE_INTERVAL.8=Near Every Frame + Outer 1/8

option.DDA_MIN_CONTRIBUTION=Minimum Direct Light Contribution
option.DDA_MIN_CONTRIBUTION.comment=Rejects very faint rays before tracing in regional mode. Zero disables approximation.
option.DDA_LPV_SPARSE=Sparse Outer LPV
option.DDA_LPV_SPARSE.comment=Skips diffusion where the previous 4x4x4 LPV neighborhood is provably dark.
value.DDA_LPV_SPARSE.0=Off
value.DDA_LPV_SPARSE.1=On

value.DDA_DEFERRED.3=Deferred Adaptive (4x4)
option.DDA_SOFT_SAMPLES=Block Light Soft Shadow Samples
value.DDA_SOFT_SAMPLES.0=Hard Shadows
value.DDA_SOFT_SAMPLES.4=4 (Fast)
value.DDA_SOFT_SAMPLES.8=8 (Balanced)
value.DDA_SOFT_SAMPLES.16=16 (Quality)
option.DDA_SOFT_SAMPLES.comment=Zero disables soft shadows. With Continuous Soft Shadows enabled, other values set the fallback ray count; otherwise they set the fixed area-light sample count.
option.DDA_SOFT_RADIUS=Block Light Emitter Radius
option.DDA_SOFT_RADIUS.comment=Half extent of the sampled emitting volume in blocks.

profile.DDA_PERFORMANCE=DDA Performance (Adaptive, Hard Shadows)
profile.DDA_PERFORMANCE.comment=Padded safe-zone capture and 4x4 direct-light reconstruction, with hard shadows. Use to isolate the screen-grid optimization.

profile.DDA_FULL_CAPTURE=DDA Full Capture (Diagnostic)
profile.DDA_FULL_CAPTURE.comment=Same 8-sample adaptive lighting as HIGH, but disables all directional shadow culling. Use to diagnose missing captured geometry.

option.DDA_CAPTURE_ALL.comment=Off: Iris safe-zone culling protects the entire voxel volume plus an 8-block pad. On: disable directional shadow culling everywhere, for capture diagnostics.

option.DDA_CAPTURE_INDEX=Sparse Voxel Index
value.DDA_CAPTURE_INDEX.0=Off
value.DDA_CAPTURE_INDEX.1=On
option.DDA_CAPTURE_INDEX.comment=Mark captured bricks during voxelization; skip empty brick scans. Disable to compare capture overhead.
option.DDA_CONTINUOUS_SOFT=Continuous Soft Shadows
option.DDA_CONTINUOUS_SOFT.comment=Integrate projected blocker intervals on finite emitter lines. Disabling restores sampled area visibility.

option.DDA_CONTINUOUS_LINES=Continuous Shadow Quality
value.DDA_CONTINUOUS_LINES.0=Single Line (Fast)
value.DDA_CONTINUOUS_LINES.1=Adaptive (Balanced)
value.DDA_CONTINUOUS_LINES.2=Two Lines (Quality)
value.DDA_CONTINUOUS_LINES.3=2D Silhouettes (Experimental)
value.DDA_CONTINUOUS_LINES.4=Conditioned Continuous (Default)
option.DDA_CONTINUOUS_LINES.comment=Adaptive uses one line for lava and portals, two for other lights. 2D Silhouettes integrates projected opaque polygons on a finite source; complex geometry and stained glass fall back to line integration. Experimental supports eight silhouettes. Conditioned Continuous reduces parallel-edge discontinuities without polygon arrays.

profile.DDA_BALANCED=DDA Balanced (Lines)

option.DDA_STABLE_RESOLVE=Stable Resolve (Experimental)
option.DDA_STABLE_RESOLVE.comment=Blend uncertain compatible screen-grid samples with fresh per-pixel lighting. May reduce reconstruction discontinuities but is substantially more expensive. Off by default.

option.DDA_REGION_BLEND=Smooth Regional Light Boundaries
option.DDA_REGION_BLEND.comment=Crossfades truncated light lists in a narrow world-space band. No additional emitter searches. May trace more cached lights near region boundaries.
profile.DDA_SHARP=DDA Sharp (2x2, Smooth Regions)
profile.DDA_SHARP.comment=Higher-resolution adaptive lighting and smooth cached-region transitions; useful for fine shadow edges and emissive arrays.
